  <para unique="1046336" format="xIndent1">See <link unique="1046334" linkend="&lt;c&gt;__sdm_vol2A_ch02.fm#57777: 06_Table: Table 2-23. Type 6 Class Exception Conditions" xrefstyle="Table All - no page">Table&#160;2&#8209;23, &#8220;Type 6 Class Exception Conditions&#8221;</link> (No AC# reported for any mask bit combinations).</para>
